###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Only the 3200-structure column of Table 1 is encoded; the rows for 25-1600 DFT structures (e.g. direct 192.3 vs C-ACE 70.3 meV/atom at 25) form learning curves. Standard deviations are kept in the labels. The direct and EDIP values at 3200 are flagged in the paper as including diverged runs.
# - Force RMSE learning curves (Figs. 2-3), MD stability tests and alchemical Si pre-training (Sec. 5.3) are figure-only or property results.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/gardner2023.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

